    <string name="about_addons_title">Discover addons</string>
    <string name="about_addons_body">Discover also connects to addons and media/subtitle hosts you choose. These services receive searches, title identifiers and your IP address; subtitle requests may trigger their own watch tracking. Stremio sign-in is optional and copies addon configurations only; temporary authorization tokens are not saved. Configured URLs may contain credentials and are encrypted on this device. Addon Library, history and settings are separate from IPTV and are not yet included in Sohva backups or transferred from Lab. HTTPS is preferred; explicitly accepted HTTP addon connections and temporary local phone setup are unencrypted. Only use services you are authorized to access.</string>
